  {"id":103,"x":480,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Castle, Dungeon","descriptions":["Water drips implacably from the ceiling of a twisting maze of tunnels running beneath the stout-walled fortress.  Footsteps echo along the passage, adding to the disorientation felt within the caverns.  A torch flickers from a rope sconce on the wall, creating a dim sphere of illumination that only serves to emphasize the darkness of the surrounding area."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":105,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":104,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":102,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":104,"x":460,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Castle, Dungeon","descriptions":["Water drips implacably from the ceiling of a twisting maze of tunnels running beneath the stout-walled fortress.  Footsteps echo along the passage, adding to the disorientation felt within the caverns.  A torch flickers from a rope sconce on the wall, creating a dim sphere of illumination that only serves to emphasize the darkness of the surrounding area."],"exits":[{"to":102,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":103,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":105,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":108,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":109,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":101,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":99,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":105,"x":480,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Castle, Dungeon","descriptions":["Water drips implacably from the ceiling of a twisting maze of tunnels running beneath the stout-walled fortress.  Footsteps echo along the passage, adding to the disorientation felt within the caverns.  A torch flickers from a rope sconce on the wall, creating a dim sphere of illumination that only serves to emphasize the darkness of the surrounding area."],"exits":[{"to":103,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":106,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":107,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":108,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":109,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":104,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":102,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":106,"x":500,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Castle, Dungeon Chambers","descriptions":["The chamber room is extremely small and dank.  Broken manacles hang from posts in the wall, their former occupant lying in a heap of bones on the floor beneath the chains.  A makeshift bed of dried straw and hay sits in the opposite corner.  Cockroaches weave in and out of the pile as they go about their business."],"exits":[{"to":107,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":108,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":105,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":103,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":107,"x":500,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Castle, Dungeon Chambers","descriptions":["The chamber is extremely small and dank.  Broken manacles hang from posts in the wall, their former occupant lying in a heap of bones on the floor beneath the chains.  A makeshift bed of dried straw and hay sits in the opposite corner.  Cockroaches weave in and out of the pile as they go about their business."],"exits":[{"to":106,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":110,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":108,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":105,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":108,"x":480,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Castle, Dungeon Chambers","descriptions":["The chamber is completely barren, with no signs of anyone or anything that might have once occupied the room.  Mold forms along the wall, its cause a steady drip of water that comes from a small hole in the corner of the ceiling.  The air is filled with a smell that is a mixture of decay and mildew."],"exits":[{"to":105,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":106,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":107,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":110,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":109,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":104,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":109,"x":460,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Castle, Dungeon Chambers","descriptions":["A putrid smell, a mixture of decay and mildew, fills the air.  A makeshift bed made from a pile of straw and hay lies scattered about the far end of the room.  Empty manacles hang from posts in the wall, the chains broken in several spots as if someone pried them with some type of tool.  A tin tray sits on the floor, covered in mold."],"exits":[{"to":104,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":105,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":108,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":110,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":101,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":110,"x":480,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Abandoned Castle, Dungeon Chambers","descriptions":["A heap of bones lies on the floor, particles of clothing still wrapped around what was once a body.  Another skeleton stretches across the wall, the remains held in standing position by the manacles that tether them.  A steady dripping of water comes from the ceiling, leaving a trail of mildew down the length of the wall."],"exits":[{"to":108,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":107,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":109,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
